    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Coffee culture in Portugal",
     "texto": [
      "**Bica** = a short black espresso (in Lisbon). In Porto, **um café** or **um cimbalino** is often ordered.",
      "**Galão** = a milky coffee served in a tall glass, with more milk than coffee.",
      "**Meia de leite** = a milky coffee served in a large cup, in equal parts.",
      "**Torrada** = a toast of traditional bread with butter cut into strips.",
      "**Sem açúcar** = without sugar."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
